1. [MAJOR] src/repl/editor.rs:241 — `EditSource::completion()` calls `self.completer.complete()` directly so all TAB tests bypass the `set_helper` wiring at src/repl/editor.rs:221 — REPORT admits TAB was dead until `set_helper` was added yet unit tests would still pass without it — pin TAB through the helper/`readline` path or assert helper presence.
